## Context
The evidence-pack assembler is its own prerequisite. This ticket is the codebase patch that threads the assembled pack into the Experiment 3 runtime so the intervention arms can use it.

## Actions
1. Wire the assembler from 0248 into the Experiment 3 prompt-building path.
2. Keep Arm 1 and Arm 2 unchanged while appending the pack only in Arms 3 and 4.
3. Update or add tests so the prompt path proves the arm-specific injection behavior.

## Test
Add an integration test that confirms the assembled pack is appended only for Arms 3 and 4 and that Arms 1 and 2 remain byte-identical to the current baseline prompts.

## Exit criteria
The codebase can build the evidence pack at runtime and inject it into the two intervention arms only, with tests covering the prompt path.
